  "content": "<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">A Presidente do Instituto de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dica ao Servidor P&uacute;blico Estadual &ndash; IAMSPE, nos termos do artigo 13 da Portaria Iamspe n&ordm; 11, de 02 de abril de 2026.</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Resolve:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Artigo 1&ordm; -</strong>&nbsp;Aprovar as altera&ccedil;&otilde;es da&nbsp; unidade administrativa de origem e destino dos cargos e fun&ccedil;&otilde;es (CCESP e FCESP) no Quadro Demonstrativo dos Cargos em Comiss&atilde;o e das Fun&ccedil;&otilde;es de Confian&ccedil;a do Instituto de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dica ao Servidor P&uacute;blico Estadual &ndash; Iamspe, constante do Anexo II do Decreto n&ordm; 70.378/2026, que aprovou a nova estrutura organizacional, conforme discriminado no quadro anexo a esta Portaria.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Artigo 2&ordm;</strong>&nbsp;- Esta Portaria entra em vigor a partir do dia 14 de maio de 2026.</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Anexo</strong></p>\n\n<table style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<tbody style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">C&oacute;digo da Unidade Administrativa de Origem</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Denomina&ccedil;&atilde;o da Unidade Administrativa de Origem</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">N&uacute;mero da Vaga no SGP</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Denomina&ccedil;&atilde;o do Cargo/Fun&ccedil;&atilde;o</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">C&oacute;digo da Unidade Administrativa de Destino</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Denomina&ccedil;&atilde;o da Unidade Administrativa de Destino</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600002</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Presid&ecirc;ncia</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">2432444</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Assistente T&eacute;cnico II &ndash; CCESP 2.06</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600095</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Servi&ccedil;o - Centro de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dico Ambulatorial - Ceama - Ara&ccedil;atuba</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600009</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Gabinete</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">2432447</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Assistente T&eacute;cnico II &ndash; CCESP 2.06</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600121</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Servi&ccedil;o - Centro de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dico Ambulatorial - Ceama &ndash; S&atilde;o Jos&eacute; do Rio Preto</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600095</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Servi&ccedil;o - Centro de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dico Ambulatorial - Ceama - Ara&ccedil;atuba</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">2432434</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Assistente IV &ndash; CCESP 2.04</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600113</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Servi&ccedil;o - Centro de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dico Ambulatorial - Ceama &ndash; Presidente Prudente</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">5600121</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Servi&ccedil;o - Centro de Assist&ecirc;ncia M&eacute;dico Ambulatorial - Ceama &ndash; S&atilde;o Jos&eacute; do Rio Preto</td>\n<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">24